      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's hear their brief exchange.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Все, я готов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, I am ready.' Gathering the supplies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Пойдем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go.' They are heading out.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Все, давайте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, see you.' Their colleague bids them farewell.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Привет бомжам.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Say hi to the bums.' A rather rude joke.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Не бомжам, а бездомным.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not bums, but homeless.' Kostya corrects the rude term.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Смотрите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look.' A warning word.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Заразу не принесите в дом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not bring infection home.' She is worried about hygiene.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "От кого?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From whom?' He asks playfully.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "От бездомных.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From the homeless.' She clarifies her worry.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "Мы будем осторожны.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will be careful.' A promise to stay clean.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Надеюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hope.' She remains skeptical.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anton",
      "t": "До вечера.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Until evening.' They will be back later.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Пока.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bye.' They finally leave. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
